Collection :
a collection is a framework (set of classes and interfaces) 
used to store and manipulate a group of objects as a single unit.

Collection Framework : provides a pre-built set of tools consisting of 
                       interfaces and classes.

Main Interfaces:
● List
● Set
● Map
● Queue

Collections Framework
├── List
│ ├── ArrayList
│ ├── LinkedList
│ └── Vector
│
├── Set
│ ├── HashSet
│ ├── LinkedHashSet
│ └── TreeSet
│
├── Queue
│ ├── PriorityQueue
│ └── LinkedList
│
└── Map (separate interface) - part of framework but it is not collection framework
├── HashMap
├── LinkedHashMap
├── TreeMap
└── Hashtable

